@startuml
title Part 1: Search tutoree & Legal Guardian

actor Marie
actor JohnCustomerAgent as John
participant "Lambda_Portal" as Portal #purple
participant "PartyInteractionMgt" as PIM #red
participant "PartyMgt" as PM #red
participant "PartyRole&PermissionsMgt" as PRPM #red

Marie -> John : 1 "I'm the legal tutor of BOB"
John -> Portal : 2 "John choose the option :Search Identity"

Portal -> PM : 3 **TMF632 Party Management** (Get /individual?firstName=Marie&\nlastName=Curie&Id-Card=00865345& Id-CardType= passport)
activate PM
PM --> Portal : 4 **TMF632** 200 OK party.Id2 + individual informations
deactivate PM

John -> Portal : 5 "John choose the option :Manage Legal Guardian"
note left of Portal
  John is already connected to
  **lambda portal** which shows all available actions of the welcome process for Agent: not covered in this use case.
end note

Portal -> PIM : 6 **TMF701 Process Flow**PATCH\n/processFlow\n(processFlowSpecification= ManageLegalGuardian, sessionId1,partyId.2,PartyId.11)\n"new session started for LegalGuardianConfig process"
activate PIM
note right of Portal : We send party Id of Marie, and PartyId of John needed for communication interaction.

PIM --> Portal : 7 **TMF701** 201 OK

PIM -> PIM : 8 **TMF683 Party Interaction** POST /partyInteraction\n(interactionDate, relatedChannel,relatedChannel.channel.id='POS22')\n"new interaction" -> interation.id1 created

PIM -> PIM : 9 **TMF683 Party Interaction**PATCH\n/partyInteraction/id1 (New interactionItem for legal guardian)

PIM -> PIM : 10 **TMF701 Process Flow**POST /processFlow\n(sessionId1, processFlowSpecification=ConfigureLegalGuardian)\ncallback\nwhen legalGuardian fully created( processFlowId1,taskFlowId1.3) Configure Legal Guardian

PIM --> PIM : 11 **TMF701** 201 Created processFlow.Id2 taskFlow.Id2.0

PIM --> PIM : 12 **TMF701** taskFlowInformationRequiredEvent":\n("sessionId1,processFlow Id2,taskFlowId2.1":\n"parameters":partyId ,partyRoleId )(search Tutoree)

PIM --> Portal : 13 **TMF701** (sessionId1,\n"callback "(processFlow.id2,taskFlow.id2.1) ,\n"parameters":partyId,partyRoleId)(search Tutoree)
deactivate PIM

Portal -> Portal : 14 Display search Form for Tutoree

John -> Portal : 15 Fill-in form & Search

Portal -> PM : 16 **TMF632 Party Management** GET /individual?givenName=BOB&\nfamilyName=Smith Number=+3396939)party serach
activate PM
PM --> Portal : 17 **TMF632** 200 OK party.Id1 + individual informations
deactivate PM

Portal -> PRPM : 18 **TMF669 Party Role Mgt** GET /partyRole?engagedPartyId=id.1
activate PRPM
PRPM --> Portal : 19 **TMF669** partyRoleId1, partyRole.Name=Customer
deactivate PRPM

Portal -> Portal : 20 Display Bob Informations + available actions

John -> Portal : 21 John Validates informations displayed

Portal -> PIM : 22 **TMF701 Process Flow** PATCH /processFlow.id2,taskFlow.id2.1 (sessionId1, partyId1,partyRoleId1)
activate PIM

PIM -> PM : 23 **TMF632 Party Management** GET\n/individual?id= partyId1
activate PM
PM --> PIM
deactivate PM

PIM --> Portal : 24 **TMF701** (sessionId1, "callback "\n(processFlow.id2,taskFlow.id2.3,"parameters":partyId) search Legal guardian
deactivate PIM

@enduml
